      "claim_id": "ef0cb18f-5490-533f-8c77-b30806a5de59",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/82c9d42c/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "fadb91dac524ff4eb395a911f03221a27b18e2d4aeb53e58a9d3ae75da836d66",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "乙酉，葬鄂王于徽陵城南，封才数尺；观者悲之。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "ef1c1924-c4e8-5076-a621-e3b6f7624b7e",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/82c9d42c/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "fadb91dac524ff4eb395a911f03221a27b18e2d4aeb53e58a9d3ae75da836d66",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "汉主曰：“小儿教以戎事，过烦公忧。”终不戒弘度。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "ef9df91b-3034-52e4-81bb-74a18cca87d5",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/82c9d42c/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "fadb91dac524ff4eb395a911f03221a27b18e2d4aeb53e58a9d3ae75da836d66",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "同平章事杨洞潜谏曰：“秦王，国之冢嫡，宜亲端士。使之治军已过矣，况昵群小乎！”"
    },
    {
