      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-046-934-december/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7fa4ed59a2133c032528dde02d97be5bd07c249c74367b904e9ac925dc12d6a0",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "庚午，詔葬庶人從榮。有司上言：「依貞觀中庶人承乾，以公禮葬。」從之。"
    }
  ]
